 a private key and is not in `.gitignore`, and it is tracked in the repository's base commit. This was not changed. Consider adding `.env` to `.gitignore` and rotating the key if it was ever a real one.\n- Nothing was committed, pushed or published.\nEOF\ngit status --short","description":"Write ANSWER.md and check git status"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":728,"cache_read_input_tokens":29854,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":728},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81009ad5-4c4f-4604-b977-8e2ceef8b1a5","uuid":"db6aac6f-2f80-477f-ae36-e7ab2a9f0a14","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:36:45.008Z","request_id":"req_011CgtUBdk42HMhNE9ssbGNW","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01MQLnTkiRpsCRSWjG6GUt2d":{"command":"cd /tmp/h-8A1RBG && cat > ANSWER.md <<'EOF'\n# Answer\n\n## What was done\n\n- Added the Hedera JavaScript SDK at its current npm version: `@hashgraph/sdk@^2.81.0` (2.81.0 was the latest on npm when checked). Installed with `npm install`, which also created `package-lock.json`.\n- Wrote `src/transfer.ts`. Run it with `npx tsx src/transfer.ts`.\n\n## How `src/transfer.ts` works\n\n1. Loads `.env` via `dotenv/config`, then reads `OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY` (DER-encoded ED25519 hex, parsed with `PrivateKey.fromStringDer`), `RECIPIENT_ID` and `VALID_START` (Unix seconds). Missing or invalid values throw an error.\n2. Builds a `TransferTransaction`:\n   - operator (`OPERATOR_ID`) sends −1 hbar, recipient (`RECIPIENT_ID`) receives +1 hbar;\n   - memo `invoice 42`;\n   - node account `0.0.3`;\n   - transaction ID `TransactionId.withValidStart(operatorId, new Timestamp(VALID_START, 0))`.\n3. Freezes with `freezeWith(null)` (no client, so no network 